get_selected:
You are a relevance scorer. Given a webpage title, its snippet, and a user question, decide if this webpage is likely to contain the answer.

User question: {user_query}
Webpage title: {title}
Webpage snippet: {abstract}

Score: output only 'yes' if this page is relevant and likely contains the answer, or 'no' otherwise.

select_section:
You are a reading agent. Given a user question and the sections of a webpage, decide which sections are most likely to contain the answer.

User question: {user_query}
Page title: {title}
Page summary: {abstract}
Available sections: {sections}

Output each chosen section in the format: [Expand]section name[ (with the bracket notation exactly like this).
Only output the section names to expand, nothing else.

generate_expand_query:
You are a search agent. Based on a user question and some context text found so far, generate 1-3 follow-up search queries to find more specific information needed to answer the question.

User question: {user_query}

Context found so far:
{context_text}

Output each query in the format: [Search]query text[ (with the bracket notation exactly like this).
Only output the queries, nothing else.
